        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The charts below show changes in the proportion of energy produced from different resources in a country in 1985 and 2003. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDhZdYUufoV8zGxIWY5lJgtrgOb\"><em><strong>The charts below show changes in the proportion of energy produced from different resources in a country in 1985 and 2003. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Energy Production by Source: 1985 vs 2003</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wVMy7Q0Kx2Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrDFdCeWqoFwNXxm6XmlZe9tgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NmfLdT37Dos7wjxDn8jlfBrmgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Energy Production by Source: 1985 vs 2003 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả phần trăm năng lượng tạo ra từ c&aacute;c nguồn kh&aacute;c nhau ở một đất nước v&agrave;o năm 1985 v&agrave; 2003.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kiepdrr3QorzRMxEyXblNllBg8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JCGpd1foto64nyxhzkalvvNggUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Energy Production by Source: 1985 vs 2003 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm nguồn năng lượng - một quốc gia - giữa năm 1985 v&agrave; 2003.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PQjhdrejFoArznxOBHJl5DuRgUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Charts</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng PIE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VJSld276foIK5bxd5QMlicjyg7A\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>trong khi natural gas v&agrave; nuclear power giảm mạnh, oil, coal, v&agrave; other renewable sources tăng mạnh, với hydrogen giữ ổn định</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4k6dA1a4oXiEWxyS5RlFN0ggPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>natural gas lớn nhất xuy&ecirc;n suốt giai đoạn d&ugrave; giảm mạnh</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;n</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgQMdmdKdoFr7OxB6yvl3fd8gMe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Nh&oacute;m nguồn năng lượng natural gas, oil, nuclear power, v&agrave; coal</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YGvedfTw3ooFWixYQrxluaDggVb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7A1d5FHDo7jQlxsJeslvz5LgBC\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1985 </strong><em>(natural gas chiếm hơn một nửa, ở mức 52%, trong khi oil chiếm 13%, nuclear power v&agrave; coal chiếm 22% v&agrave; 8%, </em><em><strong>theo thứ tự đ&oacute;</strong></em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XWCQdzquWopETRxUINSlpIA0gFc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của natural gas v&agrave; oil </strong><em>(năm 2003, natural gas giảm xuống 39%, trong khi oil </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> đạt 23%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TVyWdsxSpoIbPMx9an8l11Xugwg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của coal v&agrave; nuclear power </strong><em>(coal </em><em><strong>tăng gần gấp ba </strong></em><em>đạt 22%, trong khi nuclear power </em><em><strong>giảm đ&aacute;ng kể</strong></em><em> xuống 8%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-On18dPohnoIKHXxATKeliU42gyd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Nh&oacute;m nguồn năng lượng hydrogen v&agrave; other renewable </strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vqbqdpgaroh98ZxObJklv6DMgIh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKaRdQKWPomT7LxIdailElGZgte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1985 </strong><em>(hyrdogen chiếm 4%, other renewable chỉ chiếm 1%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlC9dOYGUoCUpfxLjmAlLYIQggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của hydrogen </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi</strong></em><em> v&agrave;o năm 2003)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWj3dJiTSo0SbrxGb0llthwLgoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của other renewable </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng gấp bốn lần</strong></em><em> đạt 4% v&agrave;o năm 2003)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SuXDdU2Jpoykjdx6uw5lxMfQgwb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFhAdUjpvo5babxqEknljNGlgDf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"năng lượng được tạo ra\"</strong>, th&igrave; thay v&igrave; viết <strong>\"energy produced\"</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"energy generated\"</strong> để c&acirc;u văn đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ov4Ad7Pt4oOjURxka4YlBY9FgHw\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JTlwduXA6oXYutxGPY3l2pUdg6h\">Meanwhile, nuclear power and coal made up 22% and 8% of&nbsp;<strong>energy generated</strong> in 1985 respectively<strong>.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4HldULYpozisqxCoSzlmDkfggd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tương tự m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"energy production\"</strong> hoặc <strong>\"energy generation\"</strong> để chỉ sự tạo ra năng lượng nha\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeAldafE8oRbZkxk0hzlrfkXgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtS2deKBgoedAvxDuCmloIWOgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Looking at the major energy sources, natural gas accounted for more than half of the total <strong>energy production</strong> in 1985, at 52%, while oil contributed 13%.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 427,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oj0UdvNc3obKJkxypGFlbbfqg2f\">The pie charts illustrate the changes in the proportion of various energy sources used in a country between 1985 and 2003.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13794,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 428,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lj1ydF5ZBobAPIxncWYlBobJgPb\">Overall, natural gas and nuclear power saw significant declines in their proportions, whereas there were considerable increases in the shares of oil, coal, and other renewable sources, and hydrogen's figure remained stable throughout the period. Additionally, natural gas maintained its position as the dominant energy source in both years, despite its substantial decrease.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13794,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 429,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjX6duXyaol4U2xaYpvlNplbgZb\">Looking at the major energy sources, natural gas accounted for more than half of the total energy production in 1985, at 52%, while oil contributed 13%. By 2003, the proportion of energy generated from natural gas had fallen to 39%, whereas that of oil rose significantly to 23%. Meanwhile, nuclear power and coal made up 22% and 8% of energy generated in 1985 respectively, but by the end of the period, coal's share had nearly tripled to 22%, while nuclear power's contribution decreased considerably to 8%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13794,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 430,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fgq3dshngooAiuxiUorl2RmIgDe\">Regarding the remaining energy sources, hydrogen constituted 4% of total energy production in 1985, and this figure remained unchanged in 2003. In contrast, other renewable sources, which accounted for merely 1% of energy generation in 1985, experienced a fourfold increase to 4% by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13794,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
